      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is intended behavior. The root of your model no longer rotates with head rotation when standing still in full body. It solves a \"jitter\" effect when looking left and right in full body as previously the ik had to counter-rotate as the root rotated.\n\nIf you need to have something appear in front of the player, you can make it a child of something rotation constrained to a bone on the body like the chest or head.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
