  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-09-07T19:50:46.430Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Use Fullbody. 2. Use an avatar with parts attached to the armature.  3. Without touching the sticks physically turn to the left or right. 4. play an animation with said parts. 5. observe that all objects meant to be in front or behind are now located on the side. Recommended avatars for testing are VoidedChaos's Genm avatar and XD_Nova's Ex-aid avatar. (Keep pressing the Henshin/Ex-aid Button) The panel should always show up in front of the player but now it does not. The recent version has not fixed this issue.",
